{"book":"nehemiah","num":5,"verses":[{"en":"And there was a great cry of the people and of their wives against their brethren the Jews.","n":1,"sm":"Sa tele le alalaga o le nuu ma a latou ava i o latou uso o sa Iutā.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Sa"},{"en":"","sm":"tele"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"alalaga"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"ava"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"uso"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"Iutā."}]},{"en":"For there were that said, We, our sons, and our daughters, are many: therefore we take up corn for them, that we may eat, and live.","n":2,"sm":"Auā sa i aio e ua faapea mai, O matou atalii, ma o matou afafine, ua matou toatele; o le mea lea ua matou avae ai saito, ia matou aai, ma ola ai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Auā"},{"en":"","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"aio"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"mai,"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"atalii,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"afafine,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"toatele;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"avae"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"saito,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"aai,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ola"},{"en":"","sm":"ai."}]},{"en":"Some also there were that said, We have mortgaged our lands, vineyards, and houses, that we might buy corn, because of the dearth.","n":3,"sm":"Sa i ai foi nisi o e na faapea mai, Ua tuufaafaatau e i matou O matou fanua, ma o matou tovine, ma o matou fale, e maua ai saito, aua o le oge.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Sa"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"